{"id":"d6d2212c1bd4c3c5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-total-computable-graph.md","title":"全函数可计算当且仅当其图可判定","display":"thm-total-computable-graph — 全函数可计算当且仅当其图可判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-total-computable-graph","aliases":["20-thm-total-computable-graph"],"display":"thm-total-computable-graph — 全函数可计算当且仅当其图可判定","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.19","source_printed_pages":[27],"source_pdf_pages":[63],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-graph]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-total-computable-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-total-computable-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-total-computable-graph — 全函数可计算当且仅当其图可判定"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.19"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义；其图以配对编码为自然数集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)=y\\}\\in\\mathcal R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)=y\\}\\in\\mathcal R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向计算 f(x) 再比较 y。反向逐个 y 测试图成员性，因全性和函数性，恰有一个成功且搜索会停止。若删除全性，图定理只保证部分可计算，不保证全函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.19；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-graph","status":"resolved","id":"15f8b03faeebed96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-graph","status":"resolved","id":"15f8b03faeebed96","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}total\\text{-}computable\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:f(x)=y\\}\\in\\mathcal R.","display":true}],"bytes":1473,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["15f8b03faeebed96","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","35073b74f84433b3","e343870c773cb68e"]}